  "description": "The performance road bike built to go beyond.\nOur Vamoots RCS (Routt County Special) blends the efficiency of a road frame with the clearance and handling needed for dirt and gravel. It’s designed for riders who want the speed of a road bike with the freedom to explore wherever the surface leads.\nPaired with our carbon MOOTS allroad fork providing the right balance of comfort and speed, while fastback seat stays and 3D-printed dropouts improve stiffness, rear-wheel performance, and brake alignment. Paired with our double-butted RSL (Race Super Light) titanium tubeset, the RCS delivers a ride that is responsive, smooth, and versatile.\nFrom quiet pavement to rough back roads, the Vamoots RCS is the bike that makes every route possible.",
